---
/** The WhatsApp assistant, as a desk sees it. */
---
<div class="wa" data-ui role="img" aria-label="WhatsApp conversation with the AlphaBoard assistant about a price alert">
  <div class="top">AlphaBoard · WhatsApp</div>
  <p class="me">alert KONKANCAB below 612</p>
  <p class="bot">Done. I will message you if Konkan Cables closes below ₹612. Last close ₹648.40 (+1.2%).</p>
  <p class="me">close report</p>
  <p class="bot">Close report: 3 concalls logged today, 2 broker reports filed. Watchlist: 7 up, 3 down.</p>
</div>
<style>
  .wa { color: #e9edef; background: #0b141a; padding: 0 14px 16px; display: grid; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; height: 100%; align-content: start; }
  .top { margin: 0 -14px 4px; padding: 10px 14px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); font-weight: 500; }
  .me, .bot { padding: 8px 10px; max-width: 85%; }
  .me { justify-self: end; background: #005c4b; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .bot { background: #202c33; border-radius: 8px; }
</style>
